                <span class="demo-mega-item-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 8h16v4a8 8 0 11-16 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg></span>
                <span class="demo-mega-item-body"><span class="demo-mega-item-title">Drain cleaning</span><span class="demo-mega-item-desc">Snake, hydro-jet, sewer-camera survey</span></span>
