            </div>
            <div class="demo-mega-col">
              <span class="demo-mega-h5">Larger work</span>
              <a href="/demo/clearwater-plumbing/services/#repipe" class="demo-mega-item" role="menuitem">
                <span class="demo-mega-item-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12h18M5 6h14M5 18h14"/></svg></span>
                <span class="demo-mega-item-body"><span class="demo-mega-item-title">Whole-home repipe</span><span class="demo-mega-item-desc">Galvanized to PEX, copper as requested</span></span>
